{"projectInfo":{"name":"IPv4 Internet访问IPv6网络内部服务器配置举例","path":"aft2","visibility":2,"categoryId":31,"introduction":"某公司将网络升级到了IPv6，此时Internet仍然是IPv4网络。该公司希望内部的FTP服务器能够继续为IPv4 Internet的用户提供服务。该公司拥有的IPv4地址为10.1.1.1。为满足上述要求，本例实现方式如下：·使用IPv6侧服务器配置将IPv6内部服务器的地址及端口映射为IPv4地址及端口，Router收到来自IPv4 Internet的报文后，根据该配置策略将报文IPv4目的地址转换为IPv6地址；·使用NAT64前缀将报文源IPv4地址转换为IPv6地址。","label":["AFT","NAT","NAT64"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-A","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-A.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv4-Host-B","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv4-Host-B.cfg"},{"resourceName":"NAT","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\NAT.cfg"},{"resourceName":"IPv6-FTP-Server","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\IPv6-FTP-Server.cfg"}]}